{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015eKA4wctn7vHU9MpKTUivB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me compile the current state of performance:\n\n**Current performance at APC 300:**\n- STARK excl trace: 1429ms (baseline: 2455ms, 1.72x improvement)\n- Constraints: 1007ms (baseline: 1634ms, 1.62x)\n  - LogUp GKR: 532ms (baseline: 790ms, 1.49x)\n  - Round 0: 301ms (baseline: 662ms, 2.20x)\n  - MLE Rounds: 172ms (baseline: 180ms, 1.05x)\n  - Openings: 176ms (baseline: 413ms, 2.35x)\n  - WHIR: 100ms (baseline: 100ms, 1.00x)\n  - Stacked Reduction: 74ms (baseline: 311ms, 4.20x)\n- Trace Commit: 245ms (baseline: 406ms, 1.66x)\n\n**Current performance at APC 0:**\n- STARK excl trace: 2145ms (baseline: 2153ms, 1.00x)\n\nNow I'm looking at how the performance scales between APC 0 and APC 300.\n\nMost components are showing solid improvements as we scale up—LogUp GKR drops by nearly half, Trace Commit cuts down by more than 2x, and WHIR also sees a 2.18x reduction. Round 0 is still problematic though, jumping from 178ms to 301ms due to the increase in AIRs, and MLE Rounds also creeps up slightly. The good news is STARK excluding trace is finally scaling in the right direction, dropping from 2145ms down to 1429ms, which is a meaningful 1.50x improvement. with the >2x reduction in workload from APC 0 to APC 300. Currently we're at 1.50x reduction (2145ms/1429ms), which is good progress but not yet 2x.\n\nWhat components still don't scale well?\n1. **Round 0**: 178ms → 301ms (still INCREASES with APCs, 1.69x higher at APC 300)\n2. **MLE Rounds**: 114ms → 172ms (1.51x INCREASE, though small absolute numbers)\n3. **LogUp GKR**: 1016ms → 532ms (1.91x reduction — close to 2x!)\n4. **Trace Commit**: 527ms → 245ms (2.15x reduction — on target!)\n5. **WHIR**: 218ms → 100ms (2.18x reduction — on target!)\n6. **Stacked Reduction**: 76ms → 74ms (essentially flat — good since the workload is much less at APC 300)\n\nLooking at where the time is actually going at APC 300, LogUp GKR dominates at 532ms (37% of the STARK time excluding trace), followed by Round 0 at 301ms (21%), Trace Commit at 245ms (17%), MLE Rounds at 172ms (12%), and WHIR at 100ms (7%). I should profile this with nsys to see exactly where the bottlenecks are.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1684,"cache_read_input_tokens":49744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1684},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d386d521-3ea3-445a-958b-d64302191775","uuid":"5e72de99-63a4-4a53-855c-424693d11c29"}
