hread::scope` for work stealing and join\n- Returns `Vec<Round0AirResult>` per AIR\n\n**Phase 3 (CPU, lines 968-982)**: Scatter results\n- Maps results back into output `batch_sp_poly` array\n- No GPU work; pure CPU scatter operation\n\n### 2. PER-AIR WORK ITEM STRUCTURE\n\n**Location**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`, lines 122-138  \n**Definition**:\n```rust\nstruct Round0AirWorkItem<'a, HS: GpuHashScheme> {\n    trace_idx: usize,\n    single_pk: &'a DeviceStarkProvingKey<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>,  // per-AIR proving key\n    n: isize,                                                       // log2 trace height (can be negative)\n    selectors_cube: &'a DeviceMatrix<F>,                           // [3 × num_x] selectors on hypercube\n    public_values: &'a DeviceBuffer<F>,                            // per-AIR public values\n    eq_3bs: &'a [EF],                                              // eq_3b weights for interactions\n    cached_mains: &'a [CommittedTraceData<GenericGpuBackend<HS>>], // cached trace columns\n    common_main: &'a DeviceMatrix<F>,                              // main trace matrix\n    eq_xis: &'a FxHashMap<usize, EqEvalLayers<EF>>,                // precomputed eq evaluation layers\n    d_lambda_pows: &'a DeviceBuffer<EF>,                           // lambda powers on device\n    beta_pows: &'a [EF],                                           // beta powers (CPU-side)\n    l_skip: usize,                                                 // skip domain log size\n    constraint_degree: usize,                                      // max constraint degree\n    xi: &'a [EF],                                                  // xi randomness vector\n    max_temp_bytes: usize,                                         // budget for intermediates\n}\n```\n\nAll fields are read-only references — no per-AIR ownership. Each thread gets a chunk of these work items.\n\n### 3. PER-AIR EVALUATION FUNCTION: `process_air_round0`\n\n**Location**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`, lines 140-272 (133 lines)  \n**Signature**:\n```rust\nfn process_air_round0<HS: GpuHashScheme>(\n    w: &Round0AirWorkItem<HS>,\n) -> Result<Round0AirResult, LogupZerocheckError>\n```\n\n**Work performed per AIR**:\n\n1. **Setup (lines 143-161)**:\n   - Extract symbolic constraints and constraint degree\n   - Compute log_large_domain and omega_root generator\n   - Build `main_parts` array of device pointers to cached/common traces\n\n2. **H2D Copy (line 162)**:\n   - `main_parts.to_device()` — copies array of trace pointers to device\n\n3. **Zerocheck Constraint Evaluation (lines 168-211)**:\n   - Calls `evaluate_round0_constraints_gpu()` (see Section 4)\n   - Returns device buffer of constraint sums `sum_buffer`\n   - D2H copy: `sum_buffer.to_host_on_current_stream()`\n   - CPU transpose and polynomial construction (iDFT)\n   - Creates `UnivariatePoly` of degree `sp_0_deg = sumcheck_round0_deg(l_skip, constraint_degree)`\n\n4. **Logup Interaction Evaluation (lines 213-264)**:\n   - Calls `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu()` (see Section 4)\n   - Returns device buffer of numerator/denominator sums\n   - D2H copy: `sum.to_host_on_current_stream()`\n   - CPU unpacking and polynomial construction (iDFT)\n   - Handles negative `n` case (normalization via `F::from_u32(1 << n.unsigned_abs()).inverse()`)\n   - Creates two `UnivariatePoly`\n\n5. **Return** (lines 266-272):\n   - `Round0AirResult` with optional zerocheck, logup numerator, and logup denominator polys\n\n### 4. GPU EVALUATION FUNCTIONS (Rust FFI Layer)\n\n**Location**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/round0.rs` (275 lines)\n\n#### 4a. `evaluate_round0_constraints_gpu` (lines 31-124)\n\n**Per-AIR work**:\n- Buffer allocation:\n  - `intermediates`: `_zerocheck_r0_intermediates_buffer_size()` elements\n  - `temp_sums_buffer`: `_zerocheck_r0_temp_sums_buffer_size()` elements\n  - `sp_