istic given the workload?\n8. Are there any missing interface gaps between Rust and CUDA?\n9. Is the 50-AIR threshold for enabling batching reasonable?\n10. Are the rollback criteria appropriate?\n\nReturn your response in the format: Findings, Improvements, Assessment."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uw2BG9BbEwwjUh8avuNUcx","session_id":"d386d521-3ea3-445a-958b-d64302191775","uuid":"231ff2a2-dcc2-46d8-bd63-6cef44530273","timestamp":"2026-04-13T14:29:36.660Z"}
